# Puts HTTPS in front of the control panel.
#
# The agent at home has to reach the gateway's API over the internet, and the
# admin token is what protects your DNS — so it must not travel in the clear.
# Caddy fetches and renews a certificate on its own; there is nothing to do
# beyond pointing this name at the server.
#
# Replace the hostname with yours.

portal.yourdomain.com {
	reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8080
}
